<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1501478613"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1542919819"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ワタシノミカタ (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HoneyWorks / Kotoha / Hanon"/><amll:meta key="album" value="水声少女 (feat. Hanon &amp; Kotoha)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:11.044"><div begin="00:00.071" end="04:11.044"><p begin="00:00.071" end="00:03.272" itunes:key="L1">Lovely sister, you're on fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的姐姐你很完美</span></p><p begin="00:03.273" end="00:06.154" itunes:key="L2">I am angel…maybe cute<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是天使…或许很可爱</span></p><p begin="00:06.155" end="00:08.659" itunes:key="L3">Lovely sister, you're on fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的姐姐你很完美</span></p><p begin="00:08.660" end="00:11.400" itunes:key="L4">Do you know what I mean？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂我的意思吗？</span></p><p begin="00:12.487" end="00:18.354" itunes:key="L5">聞いて聞いて 私の好きな人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听我说听我说 我喜欢的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki i te ki i te wa ta shi no su ki na hi to</span></p><p begin="00:18.355" end="00:22.923" itunes:key="L6">秘密秘密 お姉ちゃんの友達だよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是秘密是秘密 是姐姐的朋友哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi mi tsu hi mi tsu o ne e cha n no to mo da chi da yo</span></p><p begin="00:23.223" end="00:26.144" itunes:key="L7">お下がりワンピをひらり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐姐给我的旧裙子衣袂飘飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o sa ga ri wa n pi wo hi ra ri</span></p><p begin="00:26.145" end="00:28.914" itunes:key="L8">まじでかわいいの！最高！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真的好可爱 最棒了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ji de ka wa i i no sa i ko u</span></p><p begin="00:28.915" end="00:31.354" itunes:key="L9">いつでも私の味方<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远都站在我这一边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu de mo wa ta shi no mi ka ta</span></p><p begin="00:31.355" end="00:34.206" itunes:key="L10">パーフェクトなお姉ちゃんだもん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你是完美的姐姐嘛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa a fe ku to na o ne e cha n da mo n</span></p><p begin="00:34.646" end="00:40.275" itunes:key="L11">手作りチョコレート愛も込めますプレゼント<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把亲手做的巧克力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te du ku ri cho ko re e to</span></p><p begin="00:40.276" end="00:45.515" itunes:key="L12">レディとして見てくださいよ…負けるな私！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请把我当作lady来看待呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">re di to shi te mi te ku da sa i yo</span></p><p begin="00:45.741" end="00:48.547" itunes:key="L13">本気の告白聞いて？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要听我认真的告白吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n ki no ko ku ha ku ki i te ？</span></p><p begin="00:48.548" end="00:51.859" itunes:key="L14">よそ見はしないで聞いて！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要东张西望 仔细听好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so mi ha shi na i de ki i te</span></p><p begin="00:51.860" end="00:54.662" itunes:key="L15">ウジウジとしてないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要犹犹豫豫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ji u ji to shi te na i de</span></p><p begin="00:54.663" end="00:57.173" itunes:key="L16">正直に答えてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坦诚地回答我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni ko ta e te yo</span></p><p begin="00:57.174" end="00:59.961" itunes:key="L17">本気の告白なのよ！？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这可是我认真的告白？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n ki no ko ku ha ku na no yo ？</span></p><p begin="00:59.962" end="01:03.323" itunes:key="L18">お願い私選んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 请选我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne ga i wa ta shi e ra n de</span></p><p begin="01:03.324" end="01:06.213" itunes:key="L19">お姉ちゃんもいいけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然姐姐很好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne e cha n mo i i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:06.214" end="01:09.031" itunes:key="L20">私はもっとかわいくなるよ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我会变得更可爱哦？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha mo 't to ka wa i ku na ru yo ？</span></p><p begin="01:09.032" end="01:11.862" itunes:key="L21">理由があるとすれば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果要找一个理由的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u ga a ru to su re ba</span></p><p begin="01:11.863" end="01:14.452" itunes:key="L22">私はみんなの天使（エンジェル）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是 我是大家的天使呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha mi n na no e n je ru</span></p><p begin="01:14.805" end="01:17.495" itunes:key="L23">Lovely sister, you're on fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的姐姐你很完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Lovely sister you're on fleek</span></p><p begin="01:17.496" end="01:20.329" itunes:key="L24">I am angel…maybe cute<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是天使…或许很可爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I am angel maybe cute</span></p><p begin="01:20.330" end="01:22.923" itunes:key="L25">Lovely sister, you're on fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的姐姐你很完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Lovely sister you're on fleek</span></p><p begin="01:22.924" end="01:25.274" itunes:key="L26">Do you know what I mean？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂我的意思吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Do you know what I mean？</span></p><p begin="01:26.770" end="01:32.678" itunes:key="L27">テレビ映ったキラキラした世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">电视上的世界闪闪发光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te re bi u tsu 't ta ki ra ki ra shi ta se ka i</span></p><p begin="01:32.679" end="01:37.109" itunes:key="L28">ピンクドレス私だって着てみたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉色连衣裙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pi n ku do re su</span></p><p begin="01:37.571" end="01:40.422" itunes:key="L29">小学生には早い？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对小学生来说太早了吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ga ku se i ni ha ha ya i ？</span></p><p begin="01:40.423" end="01:43.223" itunes:key="L30">見てるだけでも幸せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但只是看着已经足够幸福了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi te ru da ke de mo shi a wa se</span></p><p begin="01:43.224" end="01:45.766" itunes:key="L31">ステップを覚えなくっちゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要把舞步都记牢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su te 'p pu wo o bo e na ku 'c cha</span></p><p begin="01:45.767" end="01:48.596" itunes:key="L32">お父さんのアイドルだもん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可是爸爸的偶像呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to u sa n no a i do ru da mo n</span></p><p begin="01:48.990" end="01:54.559" itunes:key="L33">レベル上げ苦手な方で好きなことしかしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为不擅长升级</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">re be ru a ge ni ga te na ho u de</span></p><p begin="01:54.560" end="01:59.739" itunes:key="L34">神様なんていないんでしょ？知ってるもん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神明其实是不存在的吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma na n te i na i n de sho ？</span></p><p begin="01:59.928" end="02:02.878" itunes:key="L35">私のお歌を聞いて？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来听我唱歌吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no o u ta wo ki i te ？</span></p><p begin="02:02.879" end="02:06.232" itunes:key="L36">手拍子合わせて聞いて！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打着拍子来听我唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te byo u shi a wa se te ki i te</span></p><p begin="02:06.233" end="02:08.990" itunes:key="L37">ゆらゆらとペンライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">应援棒左右摇摆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra yu ra to pe n ra i to</span></p><p begin="02:08.991" end="02:11.428" itunes:key="L38">応援もよろしくね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">应援也拜托啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o u e n mo yo ro shi ku ne</span></p><p begin="02:11.429" end="02:14.185" itunes:key="L39">踊ればみんなが笑顔になって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要我跳起舞大家就会笑起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o do re ba mi n na ga e ga o ni na 't te</span></p><p begin="02:14.186" end="02:17.630" itunes:key="L40">笑えばみんな幸せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑起来大家就能幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra e ba mi n na shi a wa se</span></p><p begin="02:17.631" end="02:20.454" itunes:key="L41">抱きしめて全力で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用尽全力抱抱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki shi me te ze n ryo ku de</span></p><p begin="02:20.455" end="02:23.218" itunes:key="L42">くじけたら頭を撫でてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沮丧的话我会给你摸摸头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ji ke ta ra a ta ma wo na de te yo</span></p><p begin="02:23.219" end="02:26.051" itunes:key="L43">理由があるとすれば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果要找一个理由的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u ga a ru to su re ba</span></p><p begin="02:26.052" end="02:28.706" itunes:key="L44">私はみんなの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是 我是大家的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha mi n na no</span></p><p begin="02:29.317" end="02:35.066" itunes:key="L45">そんな表情していたね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你露出那样的表情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na hyo u jo u shi te i ta ne</span></p><p begin="02:35.067" end="02:40.805" itunes:key="L46">“子どもだから可愛い”って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好像在说“因为是小孩所以很可爱”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ko do mo da ka ra ka wa i i ” 't te</span></p><p begin="02:40.806" end="02:46.362" itunes:key="L47">お姉ちゃん見て自信なくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着姐姐失去了自信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne e cha n mi te ji shi n na ku te</span></p><p begin="02:46.363" end="02:52.183" itunes:key="L48">閉ざしていた世界を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把世界封闭了起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to za shi te i ta se ka i wo</span></p><p begin="03:01.284" end="03:07.424" itunes:key="L49">もー！陰口なんて気にしてる場合じゃないでしょ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是 现在不是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo o ka ge gu chi na n te</span></p><p begin="03:07.425" end="03:12.736" itunes:key="L50">“やるかやられるか”なんだよね…負けるな私！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界就是“或胜或负”吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ya ru ka ya ra re ru ka ” na n da yo ne</span></p><p begin="03:12.868" end="03:15.796" itunes:key="L51">私が嫌っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我不愿意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ga ki ra 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:15.797" end="03:18.966" itunes:key="L52">あなたは味方だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也会站在我这边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ha mi ka ta da ne</span></p><p begin="03:18.967" end="03:21.914" itunes:key="L53">叶えよう約束ね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去实现梦想吧 约好了哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na e yo u ya ku so ku ne</span></p><p begin="03:21.915" end="03:24.083" itunes:key="L54">小指を重ねよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来拉勾起誓吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko yu bi wo ka sa ne yo u</span></p><p begin="03:24.353" end="03:27.170" itunes:key="L55">あなたの夢は右で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的梦想在右边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no yu me ha mi gi de</span></p><p begin="03:27.171" end="03:30.514" itunes:key="L56">私の夢は左<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的梦想在左边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no yu me ha hi da ri</span></p><p begin="03:30.515" end="03:33.296" itunes:key="L57">ゆらゆらと迷っても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使会迷茫彷徨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra yu ra to ma yo 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:33.297" end="03:35.701" itunes:key="L58">どこかできっと繋がる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也定会在某处相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ka de ki 't to tsu na ga ru</span></p><p begin="03:35.702" end="03:38.542" itunes:key="L59">泣きたい時は泣いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想哭的时候就哭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ki ta i to ki ha na i te</span></p><p begin="03:38.543" end="03:41.907" itunes:key="L60">笑いたい時は笑って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想笑的时候就笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i ta i to ki ha wa ra 't te</span></p><p begin="03:41.908" end="03:44.696" itunes:key="L61">疲れたら休みましょ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">累了就休息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ka re ta ra ya su mi ma sho</span></p><p begin="03:44.697" end="03:47.568" itunes:key="L62">困ったら相談乗ってよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有烦恼我会和你商量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ma 't ta ra so u da n no 't te yo</span></p><p begin="03:47.569" end="03:50.412" itunes:key="L63">理由があるとすれば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果要找一个理由的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri yu u ga a ru to su re ba</span></p><p begin="03:50.413" end="03:53.049" itunes:key="L64">私はみんなの天使（エンジェル）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就是 我是大家的天使呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha mi n na no e n je ru</span></p><p begin="03:53.179" end="03:56.128" itunes:key="L65">Lovely sister, you're on fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的姐姐你很完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Lovely sister you're on fleek</span></p><p begin="03:56.129" end="03:58.960" itunes:key="L66">I am angel…maybe cute<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是天使…或许很可爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I am angel maybe cute</span></p><p begin="03:58.961" end="04:01.454" itunes:key="L67">Lovely sister, you're on fleek<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱的姐姐你很完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Lovely sister you're on fleek</span></p><p begin="04:01.455" end="04:11.044" itunes:key="L68">Do you know what I mean？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你懂我的意思吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Do you know what I mean？</span></p></div></body></tt>